   $$
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{ij} = d_j \quad \forall j \in J
   $$
   Specifically,
   $$
   x_{S1,C1} + x_{S2,C1} = 144
   $$
   $$
   x_{S1,C2} + x_{S2,C2} = 216
   $$

2. **Supplier activation:** A supplier can only supply if it is activated.
   $$
   x_{ij} \leq d_j y_i \quad \forall i \in I,\, j \in J
